---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const description = 'A portfolio project by OmniAI Studio exploring AI-assisted invoice extraction, structured output, validation, and downstream automation.';
---
<BaseLayout title="AI Invoice Extractor — OmniAI Studio" description={description} canonical="https://omniaistudio.in/work/ai-invoice-extractor">
<div class="page"><p class="eyebrow">PROJECT · DOCUMENT AI</p><h1 class="display">AI Invoice Extractor</h1><p class="lead">An AI-assisted document workflow designed to turn invoice files into structured information that can be validated and passed into downstream business processes.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/contact">Discuss a similar system ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/work">Back to work</a></div><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><h2>The problem</h2><p>Invoices arrive in different layouts and formats. A useful automation must handle variability instead of assuming every document looks the same.</p></div><div class="grid"><div class="card"><span class="tag">Input</span><h3>Unstructured documents</h3><p>PDFs and invoice images can contain different field names, positions, tables, and formatting.</p></div><div class="card"><span class="tag">Output</span><h3>Structured data</h3><p>The goal is a predictable schema that downstream systems can consume and validate.</p></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><h2>System approach</h2><p>The production version should combine extraction with validation, error handling, and human review where confidence is insufficient.</p></div><div class="kicker-grid"><div><strong>01 · Receive</strong><span>Accept an invoice file through the chosen business channel.</span></div><div><strong>02 · Extract</strong><span>Use OCR/document processing and an AI model to identify fields and line items.</span></div><div><strong>03 · Validate</strong><span>Check schema, totals, required fields, and confidence before proceeding.</span></div><div><strong>04 · Route</strong><span>Send clean structured data to the next system or flag it for review.</span></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="card"><span class="tag">Portfolio status</span><h3>Demonstration project</h3><p>This page intentionally does not claim client results or production guarantees. A future case study can document verified results once the system is used in a real environment.</p></div></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
